  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Fiestas|Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/08/AyodarPrimerSabado1.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(67 fotos) Ay&oacute;dar ha iniciado este fin de semana las fiestas del verano, que se extender&aacute;n hasta el s&aacute;bado 19 de agosto. Este s&aacute;bado se ha probado y embolado el toro del pueblo, de la ganader&iacute;a Francisco Javier Arauz de Robles.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/08/PaellasAyodar.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>El domingo se ha celebrado el tradicional concurso de paellas.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sabadodomingofiestasagostoayodar/img_1639.jpg\" alt=\"img_1639\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sabadodomingofiestasagostoayodar/img_1640.jpg\" alt=\"img_1640\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sabadodomingofiestasagostoayodar/img_1641.jpg\" alt=\"img_1641\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sabadodomingofiestasagostoayodar/img_1642.jpg\" alt=\"img_1642\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sabadodomingofiestasagostoayodar/img_1645.jpg\" alt=\"img_1645\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sabadodomingofiestasagostoayodar/img_1646.jpg\" alt=\"img_1646\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sabadodomingofiestasagostoayodar/img_1648.jpg\" alt=\"img_1648\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sabadodomin